<h2>Welcome to BlueSealPro, <%= @user.name %>!</h2>

<p>Your technician account has been set up by <%= @company.name %>. You can now access BlueSealPro to view your schedule and job assignments.</p>

<h3>Your Login Credentials</h3>
<p>
  <strong>Email:</strong> <%= @user.email %><br>
  <strong>Temporary Password:</strong> <code style="background: #f0f0f0; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px;"><%= @temporary_password %></code>
</p>

<h3>How to Login</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Visit <a href="<%= root_url %>">BlueSealPro Login</a></li>
  <li>Enter your email address</li>
  <li>Enter your temporary password above</li>
  <li>You'll be prompted to create a new password on your first login</li>
</ol>

<p>
  <strong>Note:</strong> This temporary password is for your security. You must create a new password when you first log in.
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact your administrator.</p>

<p>
  Best regards,<br>
  The BlueSealPro Team
</p>
